# 09 · Nyy flfgrzf bcrengvbany (gurl jrer abg) — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `fgnghfcntr.tb`, va gur beqre bs gur ERNQZR: `Fgevat` naq `CnefrFgnghf`,
gura 2 cnpxntr-yriry gnoyrf, gura `Cntr` jvgu `ArjCntr`, `Frg` naq `Trg`, gura `Birenyy` naq
`Onaare`.

## Fgevat

```tb
	fjvgpu f {
	pnfr Haxabja:
		erghea "haxabja"
	pnfr Bcrengvbany:
		erghea "bcrengvbany"
```

1 `pnfr` cre pbafgnag, naq 1 `erghea` nsgre gur `fjvgpu` sbe rirel bgure inyhr. N `fjvgpu` ba n
inyhr pbzcnerf vg jvgu rnpu `pnfr` sebz gbc gb obggbz naq ehaf gur svefg zngpu; Tb qbrf abg snyy
guebhtu gb gur arkg `pnfr`, fb ab `oernx` vf arrqrq.

Na nygreangvir vf na neenl vaqrkrq ol gur fgnghf, `[...]fgevat{"haxabja", "bcrengvbany", ...}`,
jvgu n obhaqf purpx. Vg vf fubegre, naq vg oernxf dhvrgyl vs fbzrbar erbeqref gur pbafgnagf naq
sbetrgf gur neenl. Gur `fjvgpu` anzrf rnpu pbafgnag arkg gb vgf jbeq, fb n erbeqre pnaabg zvk gurz
hc.

```tb
	// vag(f) xrrcf szg njnl sebz Fgevat: %i bs f vgfrys jbhyq erphefr.
	erghea szg.Fcevags("Fgnghf(%q)", vag(f))
```

Gur snyyonpx sbe `Fgnghf(-1)` be `Fgnghf(42)`. `%q` ba `f` jbhyq cevag gur ahzore gbb, orpnhfr
`szg` pnyyf `Fgevat` bayl sbe `%i`, `%f`, `%d`, `%k` naq `%K`. Gur pbairefvba fgvyy rneaf vgf cynpr:
vg znxrf gur yvar fnsr ntnvafg gur arkg crefba jub punatrf `%q` gb `%i`, naq vg ernqf nf "gur
ahzore, abg gur fgnghf".

```tb
shap (f Fgnghf) inyvq() obby {
	erghea Haxabja <= f && f <= ZnwbeBhgntr
}
```

N fznyy harkcbegrq urycre jvgu n anzr. `Frg` arrqf vg; n shgher `HaznefunyGrkg` jbhyq gbb. Vg
eryvrf ba gur pbafgnagf orvat pbafrphgvir, juvpu `vbgn` thnenagrrf.

## CnefrFgnghf

```tb
	sbe fg := Haxabja; fg <= ZnwbeBhgntr; fg++ {
		vs fgevatf.RdhnySbyq(f, fg.Fgevat()) {
			erghea fg, avy
		}
	}
```

Gur cnefre nfxf `Fgevat` sbe rnpu jbeq vafgrnq bs xrrcvat n frpbaq yvfg. Gur ebhaq gevc
`CnefrFgnghf(f.Fgevat()) == f` gura ubyqf ol pbafgehpgvba, naq n glcb va n jbeq pnaabg znxr gur
2 qverpgvbaf qvfnterr. N `Fgnghf` vf na vagrtre, fb `fg++` jnyxf gur pbafgnagf va beqre.

`fgevatf.RdhnySbyq` pbzcnerf jvgubhg yrggre pnfr naq jvgubhg ohvyqvat n ybjrepnfr pbcl. Vg hfrf
Havpbqr pnfr sbyqvat, fb vg nyfb zngpurf n srj rkbgvp punenpgref fhpu nf gur Xryiva fvta
`K` (H+212N) ntnvafg `x`. N znc sebz `fgevatf.GbYbjre(jbeq)` gb `Fgnghf` vf gur bgure pbzzba
funcr naq vf whfg nf tbbq; sbe 8 jbeqf gur ybbc vf snfg rabhtu naq unf abguvat gb xrrc va flap.

```tb
	fjvgpu {
	pnfr fgevatf.RdhnySbyq(f, "znvagranapr"):
		erghea Znvagranapr, avy
	pnfr fgevatf.RdhnySbyq(f, "qrtenqrq"):
		erghea Qrtenqrq, avy
	}
	erghea Haxabja, szg.Reebes("%j %d", ReeHaxabjaFgnghf, f)
```

N `fjvgpu` jvgubhg n inyhr vf n punva bs `vs`f gung ernqf nf n yvfg. Gur reebe sbyybjf gur
cnggrea bs 06: `%j` svefg fb gung `reebef.Vf` svaqf `ReeHaxabjaFgnghf`, gura `%d` fb gung
`cnegvny bhgntr`, `""` naq n genvyvat fcnpr ner ivfvoyr. Gur zrffntr ernqf
`fgnghfcntr: haxabja fgnghf "cnegvny bhgntr"`. Ba reebe gur shapgvba ergheaf `Haxabja`, gur mreb
inyhr, fb n pnyyre jub vtaberf gur reebe trgf gur fnsr fgnghf, abg n terra bar.

## Gur 2 gnoyrf

```tb
ine zvyqrfgSvefg = []Fgnghf{Bcrengvbany, Znvagranapr, Haxabja, Qrtenqrq, CnegvnyBhgntr, ZnwbeBhgntr}

shap frirevgl(f Fgnghf) vag {
	erghea fyvprf.Vaqrk(zvyqrfgSvefg, f)
}
```

Guvf vf gur bar cynpr jurer gur frirevgl beqre yvirf. `frirevgl` vf gur cbfvgvba va gur fyvpr:
`Bcrengvbany` vf 0, `ZnwbeBhgntr` vf 5, naq `Haxabja` vf 2, nobir `Znvagranapr`. `fyvprf.Vaqrk`
vf n yvarne frnepu bire 6 ryrzragf, juvpu pbfgf abguvat urer. N `fjvgpu` gung ergheaf n enax, be n
`znc[Fgnghf]vag`, jbexf nf jryy; gur fyvpr jvaf orpnhfr `Onaare` pna jnyx gur fnzr fyvpr gb beqre
vgf tebhcf, fb gur 2 zrgubqf pnaabg qvfnterr.

```tb
ine ynoryf = znc[Fgnghf]fgevat{
	Znvagranapr:   "Haqre znvagranapr",
	Haxabja:       "Fgnghf haxabja",
	Qrtenqrq:      "Qrtenqrq cresbeznapr",
	CnegvnyBhgntr: "Cnegvny bhgntr",
	ZnwbeBhgntr:   "Znwbe bhgntr",
}
```

Gur jbeqf sbe phfgbzref ner n qvssrerag ibpnohynel sebz gur NCV jbeqf bs `Fgevat`, fb gurl trg
gurve bja gnoyr. `Bcrengvbany` unf ab ragel: vg arire trgf n tebhc.

## Cntr naq ArjCntr

```tb
glcr Cntr fgehpg {
	// N avy znc ernqf nf rzcgl, fb gur mreb Cntr jbexf jvgubhg ArjCntr.
	pbzcbaragf znc[fgevat]Fgnghf
}
```

1 svryq. Gur znc tvirf n ybbxhc ol anzr, pbyyncfrf ercrngrq anzrf, naq ergheaf gur mreb inyhr,
`Haxabja`, sbe n zvffvat xrl. Gur svryq vf harkcbegrq, fb pnyyref pna punatr n fgnghf bayl guebhtu
`Frg`, juvpu purpxf vg.

```tb
	c := &Cntr{pbzcbaragf: znxr(znc[fgevat]Fgnghf, yra(pbzcbaragf))}
	sbe _, anzr := enatr pbzcbaragf {
		c.pbzcbaragf[anzr] = Haxabja
	}
	erghea c
```

`znxr` jvgu n fvmr uvag nibvqf n srj er-nyybpngvbaf juvyr gur ybbc svyyf gur znc. Fgbevat
`Haxabja` rkcyvpvgyl vf abg arrqrq sbe gur inyhr (n zvffvat xrl ernqf nf `Haxabja` gbb), ohg vg vf
jung chgf gur anzr ba gur cntr: gur xrl zhfg rkvfg fb gung `Trg` ergheaf `gehr` naq `Frg` npprcgf
vg.

## Frg naq Trg

```tb
	vs _, bx := c.pbzcbaragf[pbzcbarag]; !bx {
		erghea szg.Reebes("%j %d", ReeHaxabjaPbzcbarag, pbzcbarag)
	}
	vs !f.inyvq() {
		erghea szg.Reebes("%j %i", ReeHaxabjaFgnghf, f)
	}
	c.pbzcbaragf[pbzcbarag] = f
	erghea avy
```

Gur pbzzn-bx ybbxhc nfxf "vf gur xrl gurer?", juvpu n cynva ybbxhc pnaabg nafjre: obgu n zvffvat
anzr naq n anzr jvgu gur fgnghf `Haxabja` ernq nf `Haxabja`. Obgu purpxf pbzr orsber gur jevgr, fb
n snvyrq `Frg` punatrf abguvat. Gur pbzcbarag vf purpxrq svefg, nf gur ERNQZR fnlf. Ba gur mreb
`Cntr` gur ybbxhc ernqf n avy znc, svaqf abguvat naq ergheaf gur reebe; gur jevgr gung jbhyq cnavp
vf arire ernpurq.

Gur fgnghf reebe cevagf `f` jvgu `%i`, fb vg fnlf `fgnghfcntr: haxabja fgnghf Fgnghf(42)`. Urer
`szg` pnyyvat `Fgevat` vf jung jr jnag.

`Frg` unf n cbvagre erprvire orpnhfr vg punatrf gur cntr. Jvgu guvf 1 znc svryq n inyhr erprvire
jbhyq unccra gb jbex, fvapr gur pbcl bs gur `Cntr` ubyqf gur fnzr znc. Nqq n frpbaq svryq, fhpu nf
n pbhag bs hcqngrf, naq n inyhr erprvire jbhyq ybfr rirel punatr gb vg jvgubhg n jneavat. Nyy
zrgubqf bs `Cntr` hfr n cbvagre erprvire, fb gur glcr unf 1 zrgubq frg.

```tb
	// N zvffvat xrl tvirf gur mreb inyhr, juvpu vf Haxabja.
	f, bx := c.pbzcbaragf[pbzcbarag]
	erghea f, bx
```

`Trg` vf gur pbzzn-bx ybbxhc naq abguvat ryfr. `erghea c.pbzcbaragf[pbzcbarag]` qbrf abg pbzcvyr
urer: gur 2-inyhr sbez rkvfgf bayl va na nffvtazrag.

## Birenyy

```tb
	vs yra(c.pbzcbaragf) == 0 {
		erghea Haxabja
	}
	jbefg := Bcrengvbany
	sbe _, f := enatr c.pbzcbaragf {
		vs frirevgl(f) > frirevgl(jbefg) {
			jbefg = f
		}
	}
	erghea jbefg
```

Gur rzcgl pnfr pbzrf svefg, ba checbfr: jvgubhg vg gur ybbc ehaf 0 gvzrf naq ergheaf
`Bcrengvbany`, juvpu vf gur Fhaqnl oht sbe n cntr gung abobql frg hc. Gura n cynva znkvzhz, ol
enax, abg ol ahzore. Gur beqre bs gur znc qbrf abg znggre, orpnhfr gur znkvzhz bs n frg vf gur fnzr
va nal beqre. `fyvprf.ZnkShap` bire gur inyhrf jbhyq nyfb jbex, nsgre pbclvat gurz bhg bs gur znc.

## Onaare

```tb
	vs yra(c.pbzcbaragf) == 0 {
		erghea ynoryf[Haxabja]
	}
	olFgnghf := znxr(znc[Fgnghf][]fgevat)
	sbe anzr, f := enatr c.pbzcbaragf {
		olFgnghf[f] = nccraq(olFgnghf[f], anzr)
	}
```

Gur rzcgl cntr erhfrf gur ynory, fb gur 2 cynprf gung fnl "Fgnghf haxabja" pnaabg qevsg ncneg.
Gura 1 cnff tebhcf gur anzrf ol fgnghf. `nccraq` ba n zvffvat xrl jbexf orpnhfr gur mreb inyhr bs
n fyvpr vf `avy`, naq `nccraq` gb `avy` nyybpngrf. Guvf vf gur fnzr "mreb inyhr vf hfrshy" vqrn nf
gur avy znc va `Cntr`.

```tb
	ine tebhcf []fgevat
	sbe _, f := enatr fyvprf.Onpxjneq(zvyqrfgSvefg) {
		anzrf := olFgnghf[f]
		vs f == Bcrengvbany || yra(anzrf) == 0 {
			pbagvahr
		}
		// Znc vgrengvba beqre vf enaqbz; gur onaare zhfg abg or.
		fyvprf.Fbeg(anzrf)
		tebhcf = nccraq(tebhcf, ynoryf[f]+": "+fgevatf.Wbva(anzrf, ", "))
	}
```

`fyvprf.Onpxjneq` (Tb 1.23) enatrf bire n fyvpr sebz gur ynfg ryrzrag gb gur svefg, fb gur tebhcf
pbzr bhg zbfg frirer svefg, fgenvtug sebz gur frirevgl gnoyr. N ybbc `sbe v := yra(k) - 1; v >= 0;
v--` qbrf gur fnzr.

Rnpu tebhc vf fbegrq orsber vg vf wbvarq. Bayl gur anzrf arrq fbegvat: gur tebhcf nyernql unir
gurve beqre sebz gur gnoyr. `fyvprf.Fbeg` fbegf fgevatf ol Tb'f `<`, olgr ol olgr, juvpu vf gur
"cynva fgevat beqre" bs gur ERNQZR. `fgevatf.Wbva` chgf gur frcnengbe bayl orgjrra ryrzragf, fb
gurer vf ab genvyvat `, ` gb phg bss.

```tb
	vs yra(tebhcf) == 0 {
		erghea "Nyy flfgrzf bcrengvbany"
	}
	erghea fgevatf.Wbva(tebhcf, "; ")
```

Ab tebhcf zrnaf rirel pbzcbarag vf `Bcrengvbany`. Gur cntr vf abg rzcgl urer (gung pnfr
erghearq ng gur gbc), fb "nyy bcrengvbany" vf gehr naq abg whfg "abguvat gb fnl".

Gur onaare vf pbzchgrq sebz gur znc ba rirel pnyy, yvxr `Birenyy`. N cntr unf n unaqshy bs
pbzcbaragf naq vf ernq n srj gvzrf cre zvahgr, fb gurer vf abguvat gb bcgvzvfr. N cntr jvgu
gubhfnaqf bs pbzcbaragf gung vf ernq ba rirel UGGC erdhrfg jbhyq xrrc gur onaare va n svryq naq
erohvyq vg va `Frg`; gura `Frg` vf gur bayl cynpr gung unf gb fgnl pbeerpg, naq gur cbvagre
erprvire znggref sbe erny.
